      "allocation": "Rank four factor forecasts into fixed35/30/20/15%equity shares. The composite equity forecast and gold forecast each need expected monthly excess return above0.5%. Both positive: inverse63-session-volatility balance with30%-70%equity bounds. Only one positive: allocate70%of98%invested budget to it and the remainder toBIL. Neither positive: BIL98%.",
      "augmented_features": "Same price features plus explicitly lagged FRED term spread,real yield and63-session real-yield change, and completed-day official VIX level/VIX-to-VIX3M ratio.",
      "early_sample_limit": "The earliest formal evaluation starts after only9distinct matured months due actual factor-fund history availability. Cross-sectional rows are not independent months. This weak early training sample is disclosed, not filled with synthetic history.",
      "factors": "Existing economic exposures are retained; rolling coefficient/weight adaptation is not discovery of new independent economic factors.",
      "history_status": "exposed_history_not_independent_holdout",
      "independent_forward_validation": false,
      "label": "Per fund: next-session open after a completed month end to the next completed-month-end-plus-one-session open, minus BIL over the same interval. Train a label only after its actual exit open occurred.",
      "order_authority": false,
      "price_features": "Observed21/63-session returns,63-session volatility/drawdown,SPY63-session return/volatility and fund identity.",
      "training": "Pooled five-fund model for the four factor funds and GLD, refit at each completed month end using at most36months of matured labels. Standardization uses training rows only; current numerical predictors are clipped to observed training ranges.",
      "validation": "Freeze both models before outcomes. No hyperparameter search, random train/test split or future labels. Retain same10y/5y windows,actual costs,source-bound regeneration and original Sharpe/SPY/15%drawdown gates."
